@startuml CardamomLens_Swimlane_v1
title CardamomLens — Initial Workflow (v1, to be updated after interviews)
|Grader / Export QA|
start
:Draw sample from lot;
:Place on plain background\nand capture photo;
:Upload photo + Sample ID / Lot ID;
|CardamomLens App|
:Image-quality gate;
if (Quality OK?) then (no)
  :Ask for retake;
  |Grader / Export QA|
  :Retake photo;
  |CardamomLens App|
endif
|Model Service|
:Classify (Premium / Standard /\nLow_Grade / Defective);
:Compute calibrated confidence;
:Generate Grad-CAM;
|CardamomLens App|
:Apply routing rules\n(thresholds from config);
if (Defective OR low confidence\nOR small margin?) then (yes)
  :Recommend MANUAL REVIEW;\ndisable Accept;
  |Grader / Export QA|
  :Inspect sample manually;
  :Record own category + reason;
else (no)
  :Recommend ACCEPT FOR SCREENING;
  |Grader / Export QA|
  if (Agree with AI?) then (yes)
    :Confirm;
  else (no)
    :Override + mandatory reason;
  endif
endif
|Audit Log|
:Write record (time, image hash, model version,\nprobs, route, human decision, reason);
|Supervisor / Senior Grader|
if (Override or disagreement?) then (yes)
  :Review in weekly queue;
  :Relabel / adjust thresholds;
else (no)
endif
|Grader / Export QA|
:Human assigns OFFICIAL grade\n(outside the AI category set);
stop
@enduml
